msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_start/01_install_arduino_ide.rst:81
msgid "Open the IDE"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_start/01_install_arduino_ide.rst:83
msgid "When you first open Arduino IDE 2.0, it automatically installs the Arduino AVR Boards, built-in libraries, and other required files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_start/01_install_arduino_ide.rst:87
msgid "In addition, your firewall or security center may pop up a few times asking you if you want to install some device driver. Please install all of them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_start/01_install_arduino_ide.rst:91
msgid "Now your Arduino IDE is ready!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_start/01_install_arduino_ide.rst:94
msgid "In the event that some installations didn't work due to network issues or other reasons, you can reopen the Arduino IDE and it will finish the rest of the installation. The Output window will not automatically open after all installations are complete unless you click Verify or Upload."
msgstr ""
